/*!
\page page_stl3trigger StL3Trigger

\brief Level-3 online trigger object: online TPC hits, tracks, vertices, and algorithm decisions.

\section stl3trigger_overview Overview
\c StL3Trigger is the container for Level-3 online trigger data.  The L3 farm
reconstructs TPC tracks online in ~10 ms and runs per-event algorithms to decide
whether to write the event to tape.  This object stores the online TPC hit collection,
track nodes, track detector-info records, primary vertices, L3 trigger words, and the
\ref page_stl3eventsummary which records individual algorithm decisions.

\section stl3trigger_hierarchy Class Hierarchy
\code
TObject
 └── StObject
      └── StL3Trigger
\endcode

\section stl3trigger_members Data Members

| Type | Name | Description |
|------|------|-------------|
| StL3EventSummary* | mL3EventSummary | Owned algorithm decision summary |
| StTpcHitCollection* | mL3TpcHits | Owned online TPC hit collection |
| StSPtrVecTrackDetectorInfo | mL3TrackDetectorInfo | Online track detector-info list |
| StSPtrVecTrackNode | mL3TrackNodes | Online track nodes |
| StSPtrVecPrimaryVertex | mL3PrimaryVertices | Online primary vertices |
| TArrayL | mTriggerWords | L3 trigger decision words |

\section stl3trigger_methods Key Methods

| Signature | Description |
|-----------|-------------|
| `StL3EventSummary* l3EventSummary() const` | Algorithm decision summary |
| `StTpcHitCollection* tpcHitCollection() const` | Online TPC hit collection |
| `StSPtrVecTrackNode& trackNodes()` | Online track nodes |
| `unsigned int numberOfPrimaryVertices() const` | Online primary vertex count |
| `StPrimaryVertex* primaryVertex(unsigned int i=0) const` | Online primary vertex i |
| `void setL3EventSummary(StL3EventSummary*)` | Set algorithm summary (takes ownership) |
| `void addPrimaryVertex(StPrimaryVertex*)` | Add an online primary vertex |

\section stl3trigger_usage Usage Example
\code{.cpp}
StL3Trigger* l3 = event->l3Trigger();
StL3EventSummary* sum = l3->l3EventSummary();
cout << "L3 tracks: "   << sum->numberOfTracks()  << endl;
cout << "z-vtx trig: "  << sum->zVertexTrigger()  << endl;
\endcode

\see \ref page_stl3eventsummary
\see \ref page_stl3algorithminfo
\see \ref page_sttrigger
*/
